    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Everything reacts to the beat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat waves of enemies in this groovy Twin Stick shooter. Shoot, move and dodge to the tempo. Try to keep your cool while you bob your head to the rythm.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >No Chill, Just Bounce</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover unique universes inspired by music genres. House, Drum &amp; Bass, Jungle, Electroswing, Psytrance, Techno, Garage, Breakcore, Hardcore, Metal... Every stage has it's own unique soundtrack, enemies, bosses and ambiance to make it memorable and bouncy.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Tough Challenges for serious jumpers</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get highscores by dancing flawlessly through the levels to unlock new ways to play the game. Less helath, new abilities, tougher enemies, alternative soundtracks, boss rush mode and more!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Everything reacts to the beat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat waves of enemies in this groovy Twin Stick shooter. Shoot, move and dodge to the tempo. Try to keep your cool while you bob your head to the rythm.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >No Chill, Just Bounce</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover unique universes inspired by music genres. House, Drum &amp; Bass, Jungle, Electroswing, Psytrance, Techno, Garage, Breakcore, Hardcore, Metal... Every stage has it's own unique soundtrack, enemies, bosses and ambiance to make it memorable and bouncy.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Tough Challenges for serious jumpers</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get highscores by dancing flawlessly through the levels to unlock new ways to play the game. Less helath, new abilities, tougher enemies, alternative soundtracks, boss rush mode and more!</p>",
    "short_description": "Insane Twin Stick Rythmic shooter. Defeat waves of enemies shooting to the beat. Conquer every genre from chill house to hectic breakbeat.",
